{"id":"act17side_level_act17side_st03","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_black","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_183#1","blackstart":0.3,"blackend":0.7,"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"High Inquisitor","text":"Irene."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","blackstart":0.3,"blackend":0.7,"blackstart2":0.3,"blackend2":0.7,"focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Inquisitor Irene","text":"Yes, maestro... I mean, sir!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"High Inquisitor","text":"You seem distracted."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Inquisitor Irene","text":"I... I'm fine."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"High Inquisitor","text":"Gran Faro is a tiny town, so small that most maps don't even bother to list it."},{"t":"line","name":"High Inquisitor","text":"But this is a request from Lord Carmen himself, and it involves Dr. Kal'tsit and those Ægir."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Inquisitor Irene","text":"I know, sir. I—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"High Inquisitor","text":"If you still haven't found your answer, I will not give you permission to join the mission."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Inquisitor Irene","text":"I'd already made up my mind when I first decided to follow in your footsteps and become an Inquisitor."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"High Inquisitor","text":"Yes, before you even knew the question. An answer is worthless if it cannot explain what you see and hear."},{"t":"line","name":"High Inquisitor","text":"Don't die a worthless death, Irene. You know what we're fighting against. And you must find your own answer."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_183#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Inquisitor Irene","text":"I—"},{"t":"line","name":"Inquisitor Irene","text":"...Yes, sir."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_ibchurch","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop","volume":0.4,"fadetime":3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"Lady Kal'tsit."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Gladiia's tone does not change, but her footsteps reflect her mood."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"right","type":"move","xpos":30,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"right","type":"move","xpos":-30,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A blink of the eye, and she is by Kal'tsit's side."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Good work, Gladiia."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"The Inquisition didn't do anything to you, did they?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#4","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"The fact that Iberia has not yet sunk into the sea is proof that they still retain a shred of humility and vigilance."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"You found a way, as promised."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Yes. However..."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Even if Iberia is willing to let go of their fears, what about Ægir?"},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"What about you?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"If this temporary cooperation is necessary to help us return to the ocean... so be it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n","loop":true,"channel":"bgs"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2004_Alty","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"bgs","fadetime":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Alty","text":"Finally, an Ægir with some sense, right? Like the waves themselves, like the rays and texture of the sea."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2004_Alty","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Alty","text":"Hello there, special Ægir. I believe you've already met our other members?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2004_Alty","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"Yes. You're also a member of AUS?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2004_Alty","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Alty","text":"Alty, bassist. Nice to meet you."},{"t":"line","name":"Alty","text":"How are things outside?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2004_Alty","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"The cultists are out in force, but individually they're rather weak."},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"My Hunters can take care of everything."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"The Inquisition will only work with us once we've taken care of the problems in Gran Faro."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_474_gladiia_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"Then there's no time to waste."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Gladiia raises her lance."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"At the same time, she senses that something is not right."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_474_gladiia_1#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"......!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_474_gladiia_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"There, among the Sea Terrors... but how could it be...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_transmissionget","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Kal'tsit here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#3","focus":3}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Dr. Kal'tsit! Their goal is—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_sp_chixiaobadao","volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_transmission","volume":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_funnel_end_h","delay":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"...Elysium?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#2","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#5","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"What's the matter?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#2","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#5","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"One of our operators is in trouble."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#2","name2":"avg_474_gladiia_1#5","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Gladiia","text":"Something lurks here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"As we discussed, Alty, the members of AUS can stay ashore."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"We'll handle this as quickly as possible."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2004_Alty"}},{"t":"line","name":"Alty","text":"Sure, we can wait."},{"t":"line","name":"Alty","text":"And we'll be happy to provide some BGM for your campaign."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"27_g16_lighthouse_street","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_skadi_n","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#3$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#3","fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"...Too weak."},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"They keep coming. Buying time?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#8"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"Or spreading... something."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#8"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"I must find the leader."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Sea Terror","text":"—Gkh—!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_skill/e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.03,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","fadetime":0.3}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"Specter."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"...Hm?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Ah... Skadi. Long time no see."},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Something the matter?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#5","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"...Are you alright?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#5","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"I'm fine, just a little tired."},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Yes... We're fighting, right? The scent of the ocean... reminds me of home."},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"But, home? My home... huh..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#1$1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","xpos":2,"power":300,"times":1,"fadetime":0.8,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Sea Terror","text":"Gkh—!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_skill/e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.03,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","xpos":600,"fadetime":0.8,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"The sea."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"The scent of the sea grows stronger. Are we home, Skadi? Is this the way home?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"...It will be, Specter. Laurentina. I promise."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Tell me then... what's that before my eyes?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#9","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"What?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2003_Frost_1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A figure strides down the street, humming a tune."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The streets are a mess in the aftermath of the panicking townsfolk, but it hardly bothers Frost as she plucks at the air and imagines music."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#8"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"Hmph!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_empty"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","scale":0.8,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#1$1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","xpos":70,"fadetime":1,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","scale":0.9,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_fish_howl","volume":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","xpos":-70,"fadetime":1,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","scale":0.9,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","scale":1,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"bgs","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Sea Terror","text":"(Slithering sounds)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_imp/p_imp_skadi_n","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"The Sea Terrors keep away from her. No, they ignore her. Is she... playing an instrument?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#4","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Does it sound nice?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"I don't know."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"char_263_skadi#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Then ask."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_empty","name2":"char_263_skadi#6","fadetime":0.3,"focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"Wait!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop","volume":0.4,"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#12$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"*pant*... *pant*..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"(Did I shake him?)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_transmission","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#7$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Dammit?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#2$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Was it when we first met? No, he didn't even touch me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_445_1#1$1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"Those documents must be destroyed, Iberian."},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"Obey, and you may keep your limbs. Attached, if you prefer."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#12$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"(Shit, he's fast...)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#7$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Weren't your friends only burning them because there wasn't time to save them all?"},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"With your skills, you could just as easily have taken them yourself. So why the need to burn them?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_445_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"'Friends?'"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The man growls from the bottom of his throat, a sound born of humiliation."},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"We are not 'friends.'"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#7$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Then what?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_445_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"It doesn't concern you. Surrender the documents, and leave this place."},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"Whether you're with the Inquisition, or with another country..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.2,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":20,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"......!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#12$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"(He stopped.)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_445_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"Yes... you've always been sharp."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The mysterious Ægir gazes into the distance."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"'Friends.'"},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"(Ægirian) We may be bound by blood, but you must stay away from Ægir for now."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#7$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"—!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_sp_chixiaobadao"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.03,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"move","xpos":100,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Elysium evades the attack, but it's immediately clear why he managed to."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_paper2"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_paper1"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The sword's aura rips the charred papers to shreds, sending the splintered truth drifting into the wind."},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"a","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_450_1#12$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Crap—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_445_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"(Ægirian) They cannot return to Ægir just yet. Allowing everyone to act on their own will only accelerate the destruction."},{"t":"line","name":"Ulpianus","text":"(Ægirian) Even though Ægir has already chosen the path of self-annihilation."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"27_g18_lighthouse_square","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"No more Sea Terrors approach."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Unsurprising numbers, for the coast. Now, where are you hiding?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"You... *cough* No! Not the lantern!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#6$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Answer me. What do you intend for Gran Faro?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#6$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"That lantern! Get it off me—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#3$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Answer me."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#3$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"Ugh..."},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"It... It's..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#4$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"What are you pointing at?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Carmen looks back in the direction that the cultist is indicating."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"27_g18_lighthouse_square","xscale":1.3,"yscale":1.3,"fadetime":0,"screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"backgroundtween","a":{"xto":100,"yto":0,"duration":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"backgroundtween","a":{"xto":100,"yto":-100,"duration":5,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A statue stands in the middle of the square."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Ah."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Gran Faro. The Great Lighthouse. Of course. You're seeking the lighthouse of Gran Faro."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"27_g18_lighthouse_square","fadetime":0,"screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"Stop... stop it... ugh..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"The nobles once called those great monuments the Eye of Iberia. Dozens of them once stood on Iberia's coastline."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Even had the Witch King's Tower in Leithanien not been toppled, it would still have been dwarfed by these guardians of the sea."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"They are the single greatest mark that human civilization has ever left on this land."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"The sea... *cough* the Eye of Iberia..."},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"The miracle... destroyed the sacrilege... argh... take that lantern away!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"The Profound Silence destroyed most of the lighthouses, and disabled the rest."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"What are you plotting?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#2$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"I see. So you knew..."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"You knew that one remained operational. That the goal of the Gran Faro project was to protect what was left of the Eye of Iberia."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#10$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"That's why you've been lurking here, awaiting your chance."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#10$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"You..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#7$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"I never expected there to be traitors in the very heart of the Inquisition. Where are they?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#7$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":3}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"Ha... hehehe..."},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"While you're here... babbling away..."},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Cultist","text":"Look under your feet... and come face to face... with your pathetic... narrow-mindedness..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#3$1","name2":"avg_npc_454_1#1$1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"What?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop","volume":0.4,"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#2$1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Dying Sea Terror","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_fish_howl","volume":1,"delay":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","xpos":-1,"scale":0.3,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","xpos":-1,"scale":1,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#1$1","fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","xpos":-1,"scale":1.2,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.05,"r":0,"g":0.58,"b":1,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"zoom","xpos":-1,"scale":1,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_457_1#1$1","fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.03,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_atk/p_atk_watergun_n_cast","volume":0.7}},{"t":"line","name":"Dying Sea Terror","text":"(Unsettling slithering sounds)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#4$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Hm."},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"The Sea Terrors are... glowing?"},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"What is this luminescence?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":6,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Get away from it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Saint Carmen","text":"Ah—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Mon3tr!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_10002","fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_atk/p_atk_Mon3tr_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"middle","type":"jump","ypos":-50,"power":100,"times":1,"fadetime":0.3,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Mon3tr","text":"(Impatient growling)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Meltdown."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_10002"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":2,"xstrength":20,"ystrength":20,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Battle/b_char/b_char_Mon3tr"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.08,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Mon3tr","text":"(Agitated roars)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop","fadetime":3,"volume":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"27_g16_lighthouse_street","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Hello."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"npc_2003_Frost_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"(Peaceful riff)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"There is a familiar scent on you... Do you know what it is?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"(Spirited riff)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"A pleasant melody, but not the one that I know."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"Then, how does the one you know go?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"When she prayed, the stars ceased to shimmer♪"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"When she wept, the night let out a smile♪"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"When she laments, the anguish sprawled upon her madness♪"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"...A song of Ægir. A sad song."},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"But I don't like it. It belongs in the past. It lacks passion, and wallows in futile sentimentality—the same as Ægir itself."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"A shame."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"You've come home, Ægir."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Home? Me?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"Sing."},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"In song, you will rediscover yourself."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Song?"},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"What memories will singing recall?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"npc_2003_Frost_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"Just sing. You will encounter your past. You must eventually find and face your destiny, or it will find you."},{"t":"line","name":"Frost","text":"That's how it has ever been, since I left the ocean."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"char_empty","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1","name2":"char_empty","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"What a strange woman. But I don't mind singing."},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Then sing."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1","name2":"char_empty","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"La la la, la la la♪"},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"When she prays, the stars ceased to shimmer♪"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"......"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"musicvolume","a":{"volume":0.4,"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_449_1#7$1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amaia","text":"As always, there's such sorrow in your song."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Specter","text":"Who are... you?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_449_1#6$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amaia","text":"I never imagined we'd meet again in such circumstances, Laurentina."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}}]}
